                                                                       <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Agent>
                                                                       <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity>
                                                                     )
                                                       ] ;
                                            rdfs:label "Was influenced by"@en ;
                                            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "General PROV-O influence relation. Prefer a more specific PROV relation whenever one applies."@en ;
                                            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/heritagegraph/schema> .


###  http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasInformedBy
