                                          rdfs:label "Was informed by"@en ;
                                          <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Activity that informed this activity; PROV-O uses this when the intervening generated and used entity is unknown or omitted."@en ;
                                          <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/heritagegraph/schema> .


###  http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasRevisionOf
