                                                                                                       <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity> ;
                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Abstract event that bounds a KumariTenure (selection, enthronement, or retirement). Each concrete subclass requires exactly one tenure edge via slot_usage: initiated_tenure (selection), ended_tenure_of (retirement), or bounds_tenure itself (enthronement)."@en ;
                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/heritagegraph/schema> .


