                                                                                                        <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity> ;
                                                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ritual or administrative event that formally ends a Living Goddess tenure, returning the person to secular status. Common triggers: first menstruation, injury causing blood loss, serious illness."@en ;
