                                             <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/heritagegraph/schema> .


###  https://w3id.org/heritagegraph/ReligiousStructure
<https://w3id.org/heritagegraph/ReligiousStructure> rdf:type owl:Class ;
