###  https://w3id.org/heritagegraph/RitualType
<https://w3id.org/heritagegraph/RitualType> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                            owl:equivalentClass [ rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                  owl:oneOf ( <https://w3id.org/heritagegraph/RitualType#Abhisheka>
